939
00:50:27.810 --> 00:50:32.482
Okay, I'm going to sing.
And you're just gonna back me up.

940
00:50:32.565 --> 00:50:33.775
All right?

941
00:50:33.858 --> 00:50:34.859
Trust me.

942
00:50:34.943 --> 00:50:38.029
